 "summary": "The chart integration formula for an arbitrary measure, the chartwise lemmas for positive density measures, the continuity of the trivialized pairing over a set and the Sobolev\u2013covector pairing have no counterparts in Mathlib or on main. The PR reuses `measurableEmbedding_extChartAt_restrict`, `measure_eq_zero_iff_image_of_subset`, `exists_ae_eq_coord`, the `chartValueL_*` lemmas, `eq_of_coord_chart_eq`, the MeasurableEmbedding API, `aestronglyMeasurable_iUnion_iff`, `lintegral_iUnion_le` and `mkContinuousOfExistsBound`.",
